{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42749","headline":"征妇怨 · 刘兼","name":"征妇怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金闺寂寞罢妆台，玉筯阑干界粉腮。\n花落掩关春欲暮，月圆欹枕梦初回。\n鸾胶岂续愁肠断，龙劒难挥别绪开。\n曾寄锦书无限意，塞鸿何事不归来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}